### Crear cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/client
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Construcciones García SL",
  "cif": "B12342378",
  "email": "cliente@example.com",
  "phone": "600111222",
  "address": {
    "street": "Calle Mayor",
    "number": "10",
    "postal": "28001",
    "city": "Madrid",
    "province": "Madrid"
  }
}

### Crear cliente con CIF duplicado (debe dar 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/client
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Otra empresa",
  "cif": "B12342378"
}

### Crear cliente sin nombre (debe dar 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/client
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "cif": "B87654321"
}

### Listar clientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/client
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Listar clientes con paginación y filtro por nombre
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/client?page=1&limit=5&name=García&sort=-createdAt
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Obtener un cliente concreto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/client/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Actualizar un cliente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/client/{{clientId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "phone": "699999999"
}

### Archivar un cliente (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/client/{{clientId}}?soft=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Borrar un cliente definitivamente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/client/{{clientId}}?soft=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Listar clientes archivados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/client/archived
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Restaurar un cliente archivado
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/client/{{clientId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Petición sin token (debe dar 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/client